NIFT_TANSTACK_DOCUMENT_V1
{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Your app calls "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"createMCPClient"},{"type":"text","value":". The app still imports "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@modelcontextprotocol/sdk"},{"type":"text","value":". That import does not resolve. "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/ai-mcp"},{"type":"text","value":" does not use that package."}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"A client app imports "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@modelcontextprotocol/client"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"A server app imports "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@modelcontextprotocol/server"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]}]}]},{"type":"code","value":"- import { StreamableHTTPClientTransport } from '@modelcontextprotocol/sdk/client/streamableHttp.js'\n- import type { OAuthClientProvider } from '@modelcontextprotocol/sdk/client/auth.js'\n+ import {\n+   StreamableHTTPClientTransport,\n+   type OAuthClientProvider,\n+ } from '@modelcontextprotocol/client'\n\n- import { Server } from '@modelcontextprotocol/sdk/server/index.js'\n+ import { Server } from '@modelcontextprotocol/server'","lang":"diff"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"codemod","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Codemod"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":true,"start":1,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"If the app imports "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@modelcontextprotocol/sdk"},{"type":"text","value":", run "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"npx @modelcontextprotocol/codemod@latest v1-to-v2 ."},{"type":"text","value":" from the app root."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"If the app does not import "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@modelcontextprotocol/sdk"},{"type":"text","value":", remove that dependency."}]}]}]},{"type":"code","value":"npx @modelcontextprotocol/codemod@latest v1-to-v2 .","lang":"bash"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The codemod rewrites imports from "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@modelcontextprotocol/sdk"},{"type":"text","value":". The codemod rewrites the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"package.json"},{"type":"text","value":" dependencies."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"This repo does not ship its own codemod."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"protocol","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Protocol"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"createMCPClient"},{"type":"text","value":" tries protocol "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"2026-07-28"},{"type":"text","value":" first. If the server does not support that protocol, the client uses the 2025 initialize handshake."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Call "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"createMCPClient"},{"type":"text","value":" with the same transport config. The client connects."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"codemod","text":"Codemod","level":2},{"id":"protocol","text":"Protocol","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nYour app calls `createMCPClient`. The app still imports `@modelcontextprotocol/sdk`. That import does not resolve. `@tanstack/ai-mcp` does not use that package.\n\n- A client app imports `@modelcontextprotocol/client`.\n- A server app imports `@modelcontextprotocol/server`.\n\n```diff\n- import { StreamableHTTPClientTransport } from '@modelcontextprotocol/sdk/client/streamableHttp.js'\n- import type { OAuthClientProvider } from '@modelcontextprotocol/sdk/client/auth.js'\n+ import {\n+   StreamableHTTPClientTransport,\n+   type OAuthClientProvider,\n+ } from '@modelcontextprotocol/client'\n\n- import { Server } from '@modelcontextprotocol/sdk/server/index.js'\n+ import { Server } from '@modelcontextprotocol/server'\n```\n\n## Codemod\n\n1. If the app imports `@modelcontextprotocol/sdk`, run `npx @modelcontextprotocol/codemod@latest v1-to-v2 .` from the app root.\n2. If the app does not import `@modelcontextprotocol/sdk`, remove that dependency.\n\n```bash\nnpx @modelcontextprotocol/codemod@latest v1-to-v2 .\n```\n\nThe codemod rewrites imports from `@modelcontextprotocol/sdk`. The codemod rewrites the `package.json` dependencies.\n\nThis repo does not ship its own codemod.\n\n## Protocol\n\n`createMCPClient` tries protocol `2026-07-28` first. If the server does not support that protocol, the client uses the 2025 initialize handshake.\n\nCall `createMCPClient` with the same transport config. The client connects.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\ntitle: MCP SDK packages\nid: mcp-sdk\norder: 7\ndescription: \"Move a createMCPClient app from @modelcontextprotocol/sdk to @modelcontextprotocol/client or @modelcontextprotocol/server.\"\nkeywords:\n  - tanstack ai\n  - mcp\n  - migration\n  - createMCPClient\n  - model context protocol\n---\n\nYour app calls `createMCPClient`. The app still imports `@modelcontextprotocol/sdk`. That import does not resolve. `@tanstack/ai-mcp` does not use that package.\n\n- A client app imports `@modelcontextprotocol/client`.\n- A server app imports `@modelcontextprotocol/server`.\n\n```diff\n- import { StreamableHTTPClientTransport } from '@modelcontextprotocol/sdk/client/streamableHttp.js'\n- import type { OAuthClientProvider } from '@modelcontextprotocol/sdk/client/auth.js'\n+ import {\n+   StreamableHTTPClientTransport,\n+   type OAuthClientProvider,\n+ } from '@modelcontextprotocol/client'\n\n- import { Server } from '@modelcontextprotocol/sdk/server/index.js'\n+ import { Server } from '@modelcontextprotocol/server'\n```\n\n## Codemod\n\n1. If the app imports `@modelcontextprotocol/sdk`, run `npx @modelcontextprotocol/codemod@latest v1-to-v2 .` from the app root.\n2. If the app does not import `@modelcontextprotocol/sdk`, remove that dependency.\n\n```bash\nnpx @modelcontextprotocol/codemod@latest v1-to-v2 .\n```\n\nThe codemod rewrites imports from `@modelcontextprotocol/sdk`. The codemod rewrites the `package.json` dependencies.\n\nThis repo does not ship its own codemod.\n\n## Protocol\n\n`createMCPClient` tries protocol `2026-07-28` first. If the server does not support that protocol, the client uses the 2025 initialize handshake.\n\nCall `createMCPClient` with the same transport config. The client connects.\n"}
